# Anima Release Notes

## 0.0.1 (04 Feb 2025)

* Initial release

## 0.0.2 (14 Oct 2025)

* Minor fixes

## 0.0.3 (9 Feb 2026)

* Updated Briefcase
* Updated AI model

## 0.0.4 (5 Nov 2026)

* Improved UI and logic
* Added test

## 1.0.0 (11 Nov 2026)

* Renamed the app from Depurador de Camara Trampa to Anima
* Replaced Ultralytics YOLO with MegaDetector v6 on ONNX Runtime and OpenCV: smaller installer, no torch
* Detects animals and people trained on camera trap images; vehicles are ignored
* Faster videos: checked at one frame per second, stopping at the first detection
* Added drag and drop of the input folder
* Added English and Spanish interface, following the system language
* Skips corrupt and unsupported files instead of failing
* Rejects using the same folder as input and output
* Dropped macOS support: Windows and Linux only
* Never overwrites a file in the output folder: a taken name gets a numbered suffix
* Rewrote the README
